# Getaway Glamer {W}, Spree: both modes aimed at the same creature, Bot2's Giant Cindermaw. The first mode exiles it; it
# returns as a new object (CR 400.7), so the second mode's target is gone and nothing is destroyed. The Cindermaw comes back
# to Bot2 at the beginning of the end step.

