Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lingering Souls
Getaway Glamer
Memnite
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Giant Cindermaw
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island
Island x13

